sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Backend
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Guest->>FE: Pick dates, rooms, plan
  FE->>API: POST /api/quotes
  API->>DB: Read rates, allotment, active holds
  API-->>FE: Price per night with GST (paise)
  Guest->>FE: Book (step 1 of 3)
  FE->>API: POST /api/holds
  API->>DB: SELECT allotments FOR UPDATE (every night, fixed order)
  API->>DB: Check available = total_for_web - sold - held
  API->>DB: Insert hold, prices per night, expires in 10 min
  API-->>FE: Hold id and expiry
  Guest->>FE: Guest details and consent (step 2)
  FE->>API: PUT /api/holds/{id}/guest
  Guest->>FE: Pay, test mode (step 3)
  FE->>API: POST /api/holds/{id}/payment + Idempotency-Key
  API->>API: Mock gateway captures (no transaction open)
  API->>DB: Lock allotments again, sold += units, create booking
  API-->>FE: Booking reference and receipt
